{"file":"R_049.eex","kind":"story","scenario_index":98,"version":[1,2],"tlv":[],"scenes":[{"index":0,"offset":42,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":44,"title":"曹操形象(老年)","body_off":69,"body_end":145,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["曹操形象(老年)"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":53,"name":"set_r_image","args":[0,202]},{"op":117,"name":"set_s_image","args":[3,7]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":89,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1837]]},"end":5,"end_off":117},{"op":53,"name":"set_r_image","args":[34,206]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,4088,2,0,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":145,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":147,"title":"红色祭坛","body_off":166,"body_end":1651,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["红色祭坛"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":10,"name":"clear_flags","args":[]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,57,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[77,66,52,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[35,52,52,1,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[208,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":24,"name":"title_text","args":["红色祭坛"]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["赤壁  吴军主营"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[35,11]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&诸葛亮\n……这时候曹操也该攻下江陵了。\n那么我们的进展也必须加快。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[35,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[77,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n没想到为了争取时间，\n东吴竟付出如此惨重的代价，\n真是令我周瑜叹息。\n&诸葛亮\n我已经履行了誓约，\n现在该是你遵守誓约的时候了。\n&诸葛亮\n如今荆州大半的蜀军都已交给你，\n一定要设法在赤壁拦阻曹军的攻势。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[77,0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n也就是说祈祷完毕之后，\n东吴就没有利用价值了是吗？\n&诸葛亮\n这对我并不重要。\n祭坛准备好了吗？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n你怀疑我周瑜的能力吗？\n我可从来没有失败过。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&诸葛亮\n噢，那真是失礼了。\n不过我记得你也没料到，\n魏军会出兵麦城攻打吴军吧？\n&周瑜\n你不也是一样吗？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[77,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n东吴的国土遭到禽兽的践踏，\n令我痛恨万分……\n不过事已至此，也无可奈何了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,11]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n花儿的心思只有花儿能懂，\n但花儿又怎能了解禽兽的心！？\n&诸葛亮\n嗯，对我来说祭坛比江陵重要，\n你还是即刻着手筹备吧。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,35,0,16,52,3]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,35,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[77,0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n哼！孔明到现在都还不知道自己……\n才是我东吴未来的一枚弃子。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[77,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n不过魏国把矛头指向我东吴，\n的确是深谋远虑的一着棋！\n连神机妙算的我也未能料及。\n&周瑜\n哼！这也无妨。\n禽兽般的魏军将会在赤壁受挫。\n&周瑜\n这么一来，曹操这个蠢货，\n就会把目标转向孔明的蜀国了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n魏蜀相争，东吴正可坐收渔人之利，\n这一切都是为了我东吴的将来呀。"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[208,255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":2,"offset":1651,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":1653,"title":"东吴舰队集结！(取消532)","body_off":1687,"body_end":2695,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["东吴舰队集结！(取消532)"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[532,0]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,53,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[0,54,80,0,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[20,64,64,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[19,64,58,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[23,64,52,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[1,44,64,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[3,44,58,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[17,44,52,1,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[202,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["江陵  曹操军主营"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,258]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n云长，这次你的表现很出色。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[3,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n……关某心犹不足。\n不杀死周瑜和孔明，\n难消关某心头之恨。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[3,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。"]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[181,54,22,2,0]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[181,11]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&士兵01\n报！\n&士兵01\n主公，派往东吴的细作传来军情，\n吴军舰船正向赤壁集结。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n什么！？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&士兵01\n规模远超过前次赤壁之战。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,257]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n碧眼儿，他将我军的目光引向江陵，\n原来是为了在赤壁做充分准备！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n想不到规模比赤壁之战还大……\n不愧是东吴水军。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n尽管如此，更不能退缩。\n我们也进军赤壁吧。\n全军准备出发！"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[202,255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":3,"offset":2695,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":2697,"title":"","body_off":2708,"body_end":3758,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,70,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[137,54,50,2,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[19]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["江陵  郊外"]},{"op":24,"name":"title_text","args":["塘上行"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n曹植世子……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n你在哪里？……"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,137,0,54,55,2]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[137,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n你还惦记着宓儿么？……\n你知道吗？\n和一个自己并不爱的人在一起……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n是多么的痛苦。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n对了，昨天晚上人家做了一个梦。\n梦见咱们变成两只金色的蝴蝶，\n在林子了快乐的飞翔着……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n飞翔着……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n可惜……\n为了你的名声和地位，甚至……生命，\n宓儿不得不做出这样的选择。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n不要怪宓儿了……\n宓儿比谁都痛苦。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,137,0,54,60,2]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[137,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n还记得你教我的诗，是那么的……\n此情此景，宓儿就为你作一首，\n以寄相思……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[20]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n蒲生我池中 其叶何离离\n傍能行仁义 莫若妾自知\n众口烁黄金 使君生别离"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n念君去我时 独愁常苦悲\n想见君颜色 感结伤心脾\n念君常苦悲 夜夜不能寐"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n莫以贤豪故 弃捐素所爱\n莫以鱼肉贱 弃捐葱与薤\n莫以麻炱贱 弃捐菅与蒯"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n出亦复苦愁 入亦复苦愁\n边地多悲风 树木何攸攸\n从军致独乐 延年寿千秋"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[30]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":4,"offset":3758,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":3760,"title":"孙权没注意","body_off":3781,"body_end":4612,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["孙权没注意"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[16]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[1,65535,0,65535,65535]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":41,"name":"op_29","args":[0,263,214]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["曹军",0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":42,"name":"op_2a","args":[0,315,234]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["杀向了赤壁。",1,0,1]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,57,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[76,66,52,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[77,52,41,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[78,46,41,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[79,40,41,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[80,52,63,0,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[81,46,63,0,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[84,40,63,0,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[208,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["赤壁  吴军主营"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n主公，迎击魏军的准备事宜已经就绪。\n&周瑜\n请主公无须担心。\n绚烂的胜利光芒，\n正为我东吴闪耀。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙权\n嗯，这次的赤壁之战，\n要让敌军知道我东吴水军的厉害。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n主公，请听长江的流水声，\n也在称赞我东吴水军的神勇呢！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,0]},{"op":20,"name