ions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[19]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n东吴水军有周瑜坐镇指挥，\n实力将会倍增，\n我们丝毫不可大意。\n&曹操\n沒錯。\n另外，東吳上次找的石像鬼戰力驚人，\n說不定他們這次也會請來強大的援軍。\n&司马懿\n有這個可能。\n&司马懿\n然而，上次的石像鬼是無差別攻擊，\n孫權自己也吃了大虧，\n他在短期內應該不會使用了。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":8904,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8929,"body_end":9005,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[3]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n大哥和三弟是被周瑜害死的，\n请主公一定让关某打头阵。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":9005,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":9030,"body_end":9252,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n到了赤壁可不能叫我成天待在营帐里。\n我要在正面交锋中打垮他们！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n如果能讓我裝備的盧馬，\n那麼我就能發揮得更好。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯，那就看你的了。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n是！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":9252,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":9277,"body_end":9846,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[15]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n嗯，嗯……\n&曹操\n许褚，怎么了？\n身体不舒服吗？\n&许褚\n没，没什么。\n赤壁之战前我想作首诗留个纪念。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n作诗？\n你！？\n哈哈哈哈！\n&貂蝉\n呵呵呵……"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,3,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n有什么好笑的！？\n大家在笑什么嘛！\n我作诗有什么不对吗！？\n&曹操\n没，没什么不好啊。\n而且这是个很好的兴趣。\n好了好了，打完仗我再教你。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n是，多谢主公！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,258]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n唔……噗，哈哈哈哈！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[15,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n太，太过分了！\n连主公也笑我……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,1]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":9846,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":9871,"body_end":9992,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[17]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n司马先生大概不知赤壁之战的事吧？\n&司马懿\n其实战事的始末都问过荀彧先生了，\n我已经有了大致的了解。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]}]}